# TCP connection-count profile for the Curtsy benchmark harness.
#
# Each value is a number of parallel iperf3 streams (-P). The harness runs one
# test per value, both direct (client -> iperf3 server) and via Curtsy, in the
# configured direction(s). Values are whitespace- or comma-separated; '#' lines
# are comments. Override on the command line with --tcp-connections.
1 4 16 64
